WEBVTT

01:40.000 --> 01:42.120
I'm the daughter
of Great Yan's Chief Secretariat

01:42.200 --> 01:43.600
and His Majesty's Grand Preceptor,

01:43.680 --> 01:44.760
Jiang Li.

01:46.080 --> 01:48.480
I didn't expect that Jiang Li

01:49.040 --> 01:50.600
would reveal her identity

01:50.680 --> 01:52.280
to stand up for the Ye family.

01:54.000 --> 01:57.040
Isn't she afraid of being accused
of covering up for the Ye family?

01:58.320 --> 01:59.320
Mr. Li,

02:00.080 --> 02:01.680
the best part of the show is yet to come.

02:02.320 --> 02:03.960
Why should we believe you?

02:04.040 --> 02:05.480
We shouldn't be fooled

02:05.560 --> 02:07.680
- by her lies.
- That's right.

02:07.760 --> 02:09.520
- That's what you say.
- Yes.

02:09.600 --> 02:13.200
Impersonating a relative
of a senior official is a felony.

02:14.240 --> 02:15.080
Perfect timing.

02:15.560 --> 02:17.440
Commandant Zhu is with us today.

02:18.080 --> 02:19.560
He should be well-versed in the law.

02:20.240 --> 02:21.160
Commandant Zhu.

02:21.240 --> 02:23.120
Tell us. Am I right?

02:28.760 --> 02:29.600
Is it true?

02:31.480 --> 02:33.280
Even if you're from the Jiang family,

02:33.360 --> 02:36.200
you can't throw your weight around.

02:36.280 --> 02:38.080
The Jiang family is covering
for its in-laws.

02:38.160 --> 02:39.640
It's collusion
between officials and merchants.

02:39.720 --> 02:41.080
- It's collusion!
- Yes.

02:41.160 --> 02:42.920
- Right!
- You are in cahoots!

02:43.000 --> 02:43.960
What a joke.

02:44.480 --> 02:47.040
The Jiang family is strict,
even with their daughters.

02:47.640 --> 02:49.840
Due to my ignorance when I was little,

02:49.920 --> 02:52.120
I was sent to Zhennv Hall
for a decade as punishment.

02:52.200 --> 02:55.120
To uphold fairness,
my father even abandoned his daughter.

02:55.200 --> 02:58.440
Who said I'm covering up for them? You?
Say that again!

03:03.120 --> 03:06.400
Governor, the Ye family are in-laws
of the Chief Secretariat.

03:06.480 --> 03:08.400
If we treat the Ye family like this,

03:08.480 --> 03:09.600
will we…

03:12.880 --> 03:14.880
Their daughter died in the Jiang family.

03:14.960 --> 03:17.920
Their granddaughter was locked away
in Zhennv Hall for a decade.

03:18.000 --> 03:19.480
Both families have severed ties.

03:19.560 --> 03:22.280
Why would the Jiang family be concerned
about the Ye family's affairs?

03:26.480 --> 03:27.800
Got it.

03:29.440 --> 03:30.400
Ms. Jiang Li.

03:30.960 --> 03:33.440
But the Ye family's Soochow brocades
are problematic indeed.

03:34.400 --> 03:36.240
If you insist
on standing up for the Ye family,

03:36.320 --> 03:37.840
you need to justify your statements.

03:37.920 --> 03:39.480
Otherwise, you'd be accused

03:40.400 --> 03:41.440
of covering up for them.

03:41.520 --> 03:43.160
- That's right.
- Yes.

03:43.240 --> 03:45.840
You say people die
after wearing Soochow brocades.

03:46.320 --> 03:47.720
I'd like to ask you a question then.

03:47.800 --> 03:49.000
How did you know

03:49.080 --> 03:50.720
that the Soochow brocades are problematic?

03:50.800 --> 03:52.200
All the clothing shops said so.

03:52.280 --> 03:53.800
Everyone in Luyang knows about it.

03:53.880 --> 03:54.960
Wasn't Mr. Ye Mingxuan

03:55.040 --> 03:56.680
arrested by the government office?

03:57.360 --> 03:58.400
- Right.
- Commandant Zhu.

03:59.360 --> 04:01.960
Since when did officials
conduct investigations

04:02.040 --> 04:03.120
purely based on hearsay?

04:03.720 --> 04:04.800
We have evidence.

04:05.360 --> 04:07.800
The victim's Soochow brocade
is kept at the government office.

04:08.400 --> 04:11.360
That's why we're here to take
the one in charge of interrogation.

04:11.440 --> 04:13.360
Did you check the victim's cause of death?

04:13.840 --> 04:16.320
What exactly is the problem
with the Ye family's Soochow brocade?

04:17.440 --> 04:18.560
It's yet to be investigated.

04:18.640 --> 04:20.640
Since it's still pending investigation,

04:21.320 --> 04:22.680
that means you don't have evidence.

04:22.760 --> 04:24.360
Performing arrests without evidence.

04:25.040 --> 04:27.760
Is this how careless
the Governor of Luyang works?

04:28.960 --> 04:30.400
Mind your words, Ms. Jiang Li.

04:30.480 --> 04:31.840
There's a murder case in Luyang,

04:31.920 --> 04:34.040
so the Governor can investigate
and handle it.

04:34.120 --> 04:36.920
The Ye family's Soochow brocades
are sold in the Central Plains.

04:37.000 --> 04:38.640
I came from the capital.

04:38.720 --> 04:41.040
Many nobles and officials
in the capital are wearing it.

04:42.040 --> 04:43.240
If, like you said,

04:43.320 --> 04:45.000
people who wear
the Soochow brocade may die

04:45.080 --> 04:46.680
and it's not a coincidence,

04:46.760 --> 04:48.760
then I suppose not only
Luyang's Soochow brocades

04:48.840 --> 04:49.880
are problematic,

04:49.960 --> 04:52.400
but those in other places too.

04:53.160 --> 04:54.840
If the nobles and officials in the capital

04:54.920 --> 04:57.040
really die after wearing Soochow brocade,

04:58.240 --> 05:00.280
it'll certainly create chaos.

05:00.880 --> 05:02.160
This is very serious.

05:02.240 --> 05:04.600
It concerns the lives
of all the people of Great Yan.

05:05.120 --> 05:06.360
Isn't it absolutely imperative

05:06.440 --> 05:09.760
that we find out what exactly is wrong
with the Ye family's Soochow brocade?

05:09.840 --> 05:11.920
You keep stopping us
from performing an arrest.

05:12.400 --> 05:13.720
How can we investigate it clearly?

05:14.440 --> 05:16.080
I've never stopped you.

05:16.640 --> 05:19.200
The head of the Ye family is in jail now.

05:19.280 --> 05:20.600
Everyone in Lizheng Hall

05:20.680 --> 05:21.880
has no idea about this.

05:22.640 --> 05:27.120
Moreover, you just said
the evidence is at the government office.

05:27.200 --> 05:30.760
Then you should perform an autopsy,
keep a sample, and write a document,

05:30.840 --> 05:32.520
and send it to the capital's
Office of Weaving and Dyeing.

05:32.600 --> 05:34.920
Afterward, they will send
their officials to Luyang

05:35.000 --> 05:36.920
to investigate the Soochow brocade case.

05:38.200 --> 05:39.760
But what did Governor Tong do instead?

05:39.840 --> 05:42.560
They barged into the residence
to arrest him for interrogation

05:42.640 --> 05:44.960
but did not mention
the Office of Weaving and Dyeing at all.

05:45.040 --> 05:47.120
I think he's the one
covering up for the Ye family.

05:48.000 --> 05:50.920
Why didn't you ask the Office
of Weaving and Dyeing to investigate this?

05:51.000 --> 05:52.840
Yes. What exactly is wrong
with the brocades?

05:52.920 --> 05:55.240
Jiang Li's distortion of the truth

05:55.320 --> 05:58.480
is really impressive.

05:59.040 --> 06:00.880
It's more than a distortion of the truth.

06:00.960 --> 06:01.960
Mr. Li.

06:02.560 --> 06:04.880
She seems proficient

06:04.960 --> 06:06.200
in throwing her weight around.

06:07.560 --> 06:08.600
Commandant Zhu.

06:09.680 --> 06:11.440
Please pass my message to Governor Tong.

06:12.000 --> 06:14.400
I've already written
to my father about this.

06:14.960 --> 06:17.440
He'll ask the Office of Weaving
and Dyeing to investigate this.

06:18.000 --> 06:21.320
In just a few days, the Office of Weaving
and Dyeing will send people to Luyang.

06:21.400 --> 06:24.600
By then, the truth
behind the Ye family's Soochow brocade

06:24.680 --> 06:26.640
will be revealed.

06:28.680 --> 06:30.080
Don't worry.

06:30.960 --> 06:33.000
My second uncle is still detained.

06:33.080 --> 06:35.040
The Ye family will not make off.

06:35.120 --> 06:36.200
Commandant Zhu.

06:36.280 --> 06:37.440
I've made myself clear.

06:37.920 --> 06:39.640
If you insist on arresting her,

06:40.360 --> 06:42.400
you shall face the consequences.

06:50.440 --> 06:51.480
Retreat.

06:52.560 --> 06:53.800
Hey, why are they leaving?

06:53.880 --> 06:55.760
- Are they leaving?
- Are they leaving?

06:55.840 --> 06:58.560
- Right.
- Yes.

06:59.120 --> 07:00.680
I have an idea,

07:00.760 --> 07:01.880
but it might cost some money.

07:01.960 --> 07:03.120
No problem.

07:03.960 --> 07:05.160
Everyone.

07:05.240 --> 07:06.320
The Ye family wishes to keep

07:06.400 --> 07:08.640
the Soochow brocade you bought
as evidence.

07:08.720 --> 07:10.440
Aside from returning your money,

07:10.520 --> 07:12.960
we'll provide additional compensation.

07:13.960 --> 07:14.880
- Really?
- That's great!

07:17.120 --> 07:18.560
Sir.

07:19.280 --> 07:21.440
Please bring out all the cash in the shop.

07:21.520 --> 07:23.520
If it's not enough,
send someone home to get more.

07:23.600 --> 07:25.080
Register them personally.

07:25.640 --> 07:26.600
Yes.

07:26.680 --> 07:29.240
Everyone, if you'd like
to return the cloth,

07:29.320 --> 07:30.720
please line up here.

07:31.400 --> 07:32.360
This way, please.

07:32.440 --> 07:33.680
- Come on.
- Let's go.

07:33.760 --> 07:34.760
One by one.

07:36.760 --> 07:38.240
What a great show.

07:38.720 --> 07:40.360
The beginning was mediocre,

07:40.880 --> 07:42.800
but there was a sudden climax
toward the end.

07:42.880 --> 07:45.200
It's worth the money
that you paid for tea, Mr. Li.

07:46.040 --> 07:46.960
Mr. Li.

07:47.040 --> 07:47.880
What do you think?

07:49.200 --> 07:51.640
A mere young lady is very capable.

07:52.560 --> 07:53.880
That's interesting indeed.

07:55.760 --> 07:57.880
I just wonder if Chancellor Jiang
in the capital

07:57.960 --> 07:59.080
finds out about this,

07:59.680 --> 08:01.720
will he blame her?

08:01.800 --> 08:03.880
If Chancellor Jiang learns

08:03.960 --> 08:05.440
that you're involved in this,

08:06.120 --> 08:07.480
he'll be cheering

08:07.560 --> 08:09.640
for his daughter for fighting

08:10.360 --> 08:11.720
against the evil forces today.

08:37.360 --> 08:38.200
My lord.

08:38.679 --> 08:40.799
Li Jin was right.

08:40.880 --> 08:43.200
Jiang Li leveraged Jiang Yuanbai's name.

08:43.280 --> 08:44.159
Isn't she scared…

08:44.240 --> 08:45.920
She needs to leverage
Jiang Yuanbai's name.

08:46.560 --> 08:48.400
Since Jiang Yuanbai
is the Chief Secretariat,

08:49.160 --> 08:50.800
Tong Zhiyang will be somewhat wary.

08:50.880 --> 08:54.160
But Tong Zhiyang
has the Li family behind him.

08:54.240 --> 08:55.480
She's worsening the dispute

08:55.560 --> 08:57.280
between the Jiang and Li families

08:57.360 --> 08:58.520
without any room for maneuver.

08:58.600 --> 08:59.840
Why?

09:00.880 --> 09:02.720
That's her own agenda.

09:02.800 --> 09:03.920
Come on. Drink some water.

09:04.000 --> 09:04.960
Soothe your throat.

09:10.600 --> 09:11.480
She saw us.

09:19.120 --> 09:21.320
It seems like Ms. Jiang Li
is still in a rage.

09:21.880 --> 09:23.680
Invite her again, Wen Ji.

09:23.760 --> 09:26.080
It seems like Ms. Jiang Li

09:26.160 --> 09:27.520
isn't willing to meet you, my lord.

09:29.840 --> 09:31.120
Tell Ms. Jiang Li

09:31.760 --> 09:35.200
that I enjoyed
a pot of good tea with Mr. Li.

09:35.280 --> 09:36.120
Yes.

09:41.520 --> 09:44.440
Did Li Jin
find this spot to watch the show

09:45.280 --> 09:46.880
or was it you, Duke Su?

09:49.600 --> 09:50.760
Is there a difference?

09:52.960 --> 09:53.800
Yes.

09:53.880 --> 09:55.640
If Li Jin found this place,

09:55.720 --> 09:58.280
then I enjoyed putting on an act.

09:58.960 --> 09:59.920
But if it was you…

10:00.000 --> 10:01.080
Do you have stage fright?

10:01.160 --> 10:02.480
I don't have stage fright.

10:03.160 --> 10:05.040
After watching every show,

10:06.600 --> 10:08.240
you'd always invite me over.

10:09.160 --> 10:11.000
Your words are specious

10:11.680 --> 10:12.560
and apathetic,

10:14.160 --> 10:15.360
yet they hit the bull's-eye

10:15.960 --> 10:17.000
and touch the key points,

10:18.240 --> 10:19.320
making me owe you

10:20.200 --> 10:21.160
and indebted to you.

10:21.840 --> 10:22.680
Yet you

10:23.680 --> 10:25.000
sit up high at the tea house,

10:25.760 --> 10:27.000
showing none of your cards.

10:28.520 --> 10:30.400
Do you really just want to watch a show?

10:35.840 --> 10:37.360
Are you getting angry at me?

10:37.440 --> 10:38.520
Can't I?

10:38.600 --> 10:40.080
Your words are really pleasant then.

10:40.160 --> 10:41.080
You…

10:41.680 --> 10:43.680
It's better to investigate
from an elevated place.

10:44.200 --> 10:46.120
A brothel isn't an elevated space.

10:50.960 --> 10:52.560
Do you have to win with your words?

10:58.520 --> 11:01.720
The person you met
at the brothel is Wu Lan.

11:02.600 --> 11:03.480
Wu Lan?

11:04.560 --> 11:05.680
That's a nice name.

11:06.240 --> 11:08.040
She's the accomplice
Little Taohong mentioned.

11:14.280 --> 11:15.120
Really?

11:16.760 --> 11:18.520
What does this
have to do with the Ye family then?

11:19.360 --> 11:20.520
Nothing much.

11:20.600 --> 11:21.720
I just think

11:23.080 --> 11:24.120
you should know about this.

11:26.360 --> 11:27.200
All right.

11:27.280 --> 11:28.440
Well noted on that.

11:36.640 --> 11:38.480
Did she understand my explanation?

11:39.560 --> 11:40.480
My lord.

11:40.560 --> 11:41.600
I understood.

11:42.200 --> 11:43.080
You

11:43.160 --> 11:44.680
were not a brothel customer.

11:46.480 --> 11:48.080
My lord is definitely not.

11:53.080 --> 11:53.920
HELP OTHERS AND MAKE YOU
AND YOUR FAMILY HAPPY

11:54.000 --> 11:55.560
Jiang Li is really incredible.

11:56.280 --> 12:00.200
With just a few words,
she dominated the crowd.

12:00.280 --> 12:02.360
Those lower-than-low
and shameless scoundrels

12:02.440 --> 12:04.240
and despicable scums were so terrified

12:04.320 --> 12:05.360
that they couldn't even

12:05.440 --> 12:06.880
open their mouths.

12:06.960 --> 12:09.280
That was how Lizheng Hall was saved.

12:09.360 --> 12:13.000
It's all thanks to Jiang Li.

12:13.680 --> 12:15.560
We're a family.

12:16.040 --> 12:17.880
That's what I should do.

12:18.440 --> 12:19.640
You're too modest, Jiang Li.

12:19.720 --> 12:21.560
It was all thanks to you today.

12:22.040 --> 12:23.200
It's really odd.

12:23.680 --> 12:26.480
The officials treated us
harshly yesterday.

12:26.560 --> 12:28.480
Yet today, they were so polite.

12:28.960 --> 12:31.120
They even said
it was just a misunderstanding.

12:31.200 --> 12:32.120
We thought

12:32.200 --> 12:34.320
we'd need to spend a fortune to see him.

12:34.840 --> 12:38.000
But he was acting oddly
and didn't take a single cent.

12:38.080 --> 12:40.360
Governor Tong must be wary
of Chancellor Jiang.

12:40.440 --> 12:42.120
Hence, he changed his attitude.

12:42.200 --> 12:44.680
He's greedy
yet afraid of ruining his career.

12:44.760 --> 12:46.480
Tong Zhiyang is truly a vile man.

12:46.560 --> 12:47.400
No need to fear him.

12:48.200 --> 12:51.640
But today's suppression is just temporary.

12:51.720 --> 12:53.040
We shouldn't let down our guard.

12:54.080 --> 12:54.920
Jiang Li.

12:55.000 --> 12:56.760
Did you really write to your father?

12:57.840 --> 13:00.240
Would your father really help us out?

13:00.800 --> 13:03.800
It's too complicated
to explain to my father in words.

13:04.440 --> 13:06.280
The letter was for Shijie.

13:06.840 --> 13:09.560
Shijie is the new Vice Director
of the Ministry of Revenue.

13:09.640 --> 13:11.680
If he seeks help
from the Office of Weaving and Dyeing

13:11.760 --> 13:13.240
to conduct an investigation in Luyang,

13:13.320 --> 13:15.240
they'll consider it for his sake.

13:15.320 --> 13:16.600
As for my father,

13:18.560 --> 13:20.160
I just used him to threaten Tong Zhiyang.

13:20.920 --> 13:23.880
Otherwise, they won't let us off
easily today.

13:23.960 --> 13:24.800
Jiang Li.

13:25.280 --> 13:27.400
If you use your father's name like that,

13:27.480 --> 13:29.280
will he get upset?

13:30.960 --> 13:33.560
My father spent his whole life
building a good reputation.

13:33.640 --> 13:35.240
If we can't leverage it to protect family

13:35.320 --> 13:36.680
or the innocents,

13:37.840 --> 13:38.960
it's useless.

13:39.600 --> 13:40.480
Look at you.

13:40.560 --> 13:41.920
You're too daring.

13:42.000 --> 13:43.080
You acted on your own.

13:43.160 --> 13:46.080
After you return to the capital,
your father might reprimand you.

13:46.160 --> 13:48.240
If this goes well,

13:48.320 --> 13:49.960
it's advantageous for my father.

13:50.040 --> 13:51.320
He won't reprimand me.

13:51.800 --> 13:53.600
As for Tong Zhiyang,

13:53.680 --> 13:55.400
he hasn't dared
to make any moves recently.

13:56.160 --> 13:57.800
As for the recalled Soochow brocade,

13:57.880 --> 13:58.880
they need to be kept well.

13:58.960 --> 14:01.320
The Soochow brocade
that I'm wearing is perfectly fine.

14:01.400 --> 14:04.120
This means that the problematic
Soochow brocade just appeared recently.

14:04.200 --> 14:05.600
Or it can also mean…

14:05.680 --> 14:07.800
It's only found in Luyang.

14:08.440 --> 14:09.360
At this point,

14:09.440 --> 14:10.600
I only hope
the Office of Weaving and Dyeing

14:11.200 --> 14:13.440
can prove
that the Soochow brocade has no problem

14:13.520 --> 14:14.760
and clear the Ye family's name.

14:14.840 --> 14:15.920
Jia'er.

14:17.600 --> 14:18.760
Aunt Zhuo.

14:22.280 --> 14:23.120
I believe

14:23.600 --> 14:25.840
that we'll surely overcome this hurdle.

14:33.200 --> 14:35.320
My father kept mentioning you,
Governor Tong.

14:35.400 --> 14:37.320
He said that you're quick-witted

14:37.960 --> 14:39.080
and capable.

14:40.320 --> 14:42.240
It's my honor to finally meet you today.

14:42.840 --> 14:43.720
I'm flattered.

14:44.440 --> 14:45.560
I'm really flattered.

14:46.680 --> 14:49.200
If this doesn't involve Chancellor Jiang,

14:49.280 --> 14:50.440
it can surely be done.

14:50.520 --> 14:52.200
My father has a message for you.

14:53.440 --> 14:55.320
Don't worry about Chancellor Jiang.

14:55.840 --> 14:58.120
You just need to do
what he told you to do.

14:58.960 --> 15:00.600
One-tenth of the Ye family's fortune

15:02.240 --> 15:03.160
will then

15:03.720 --> 15:04.560
be yours.

15:06.720 --> 15:07.760
Thank you, Mr. Li.

15:08.360 --> 15:09.560
Thank you to Chancellor Li.

15:09.640 --> 15:12.120
I left the capital in secret,
so I can't stay long.

15:12.200 --> 15:14.200
That's why I must return
to the capital tomorrow.

15:14.280 --> 15:15.640
I'll leave the rest

15:16.880 --> 15:17.760
to you.

15:17.840 --> 15:20.240
You and Chancellor Li can rest assured.

15:20.720 --> 15:22.920
As long as I have Ye Mingxuan in my hands,

15:23.000 --> 15:25.520
we can certainly
gobble up the rich Ye family.

15:29.760 --> 15:30.920
Thank you.

15:31.000 --> 15:32.840
I'll do my best.

15:43.240 --> 15:47.360
LUYANG

15:47.920 --> 15:48.760
Director.

15:49.240 --> 15:50.680
We're already inside Luyang City.

15:51.240 --> 15:52.360
As soon as we arrive,

15:52.840 --> 15:54.680
I'm afraid the Ye family

15:54.760 --> 15:56.560
and the Governor will be looking for us.

15:56.640 --> 15:57.480
LI YU

15:57.560 --> 16:00.520
Who should we side with?

16:00.600 --> 16:03.200
Since the Jiang family
is the one bringing the charge,

16:04.120 --> 16:05.760
we should consider the Jiang family first.

16:06.560 --> 16:08.400
But we shouldn't go
against the Governor either.

16:11.200 --> 16:13.440
Only a few dare to accuse the in-laws

16:13.960 --> 16:15.040
of the Chief Secretariat.

16:15.720 --> 16:17.920
The case isn't as simple as it seems.

16:18.480 --> 16:20.880
However, if we don't provide
an explanation to Ms. Jiang Li…

16:21.440 --> 16:22.520
When big shots fight,

16:22.600 --> 16:23.720
the minions suffer.

16:24.960 --> 16:26.200
The Office of Weaving and Dyeing

16:26.840 --> 16:28.480
must not be manipulated.

16:28.560 --> 16:29.400
Got it?

16:29.480 --> 16:30.600
Yes.

16:34.840 --> 16:36.240
LUYANG GOVERNMENT OFFICE

16:36.320 --> 16:39.520
Where are the people
of the Office of Weaving and Dyeing now?

16:39.600 --> 16:41.360
They have just arrived.

16:41.440 --> 16:43.720
They are heading to the government office.

16:44.360 --> 16:45.680
Great timing.

16:46.200 --> 16:47.600
Let's show them

16:47.680 --> 16:51.480
who's the one in charge in Luyang.

16:51.560 --> 16:56.120
Also, Ms. Jiang Li came
to the government office.

16:56.200 --> 16:57.840
How many are there?

16:58.320 --> 16:59.440
There are two of them.

17:00.600 --> 17:02.560
Well, Ms. Jiang Li.

17:03.040 --> 17:06.319
How daring of you,
coming alone to take the man from me.

17:08.079 --> 17:11.760
I shall meet you in person then.

17:15.920 --> 17:22.440
BRIGHT AND CLEAR

17:23.000 --> 17:23.839
Governor.

17:27.040 --> 17:29.320
Excuse me for not going out
to welcome you.

17:29.400 --> 17:31.600
You didn't inform me earlier.

17:32.080 --> 17:34.880
Otherwise, I'd have prepared tea for you.

17:35.520 --> 17:38.200
I was afraid that if I told you,

17:38.280 --> 17:39.400
you wouldn't let me in.

17:40.480 --> 17:42.440
I wouldn't do that.

17:43.880 --> 17:46.760
As the Governor of Luyang,

17:47.240 --> 17:49.800
all I want is for the people of Luyang

17:49.880 --> 17:52.880
to roam freely
and live a good life in the city.

17:52.960 --> 17:54.760
Why would I stop you from coming here?

17:55.320 --> 17:58.920
Besides, you're a noble.

17:59.000 --> 18:01.040
We wouldn't dare to go against you.

18:01.120 --> 18:03.400
You're retreating to advance.

18:04.640 --> 18:06.680
I should keep it

18:06.760 --> 18:07.640
professional too.

18:08.880 --> 18:10.400
If you're righteous,

18:11.040 --> 18:13.040
you don't need
to be afraid of offending anyone.

18:13.120 --> 18:14.680
It seems like you are trying

18:14.760 --> 18:16.360
to suppress low-ranking officials like us

18:16.440 --> 18:18.560
with your father's power.

18:20.400 --> 18:23.080
Do you mean the Governor of Luyang
is afraid of high-ranking officials

18:23.160 --> 18:25.000
and doesn't dare
to bring justice to the people?

18:25.080 --> 18:26.880
What do you mean?

18:26.960 --> 18:29.640
I'm begging you to bring justice
to the people, Governor Tong.

18:30.200 --> 18:32.480
As long as the Soochow brocade case
isn't solved,

18:32.560 --> 18:33.600
I can't live in peace.

18:34.120 --> 18:36.080
I heard the Office of Weaving
and Dyeing officials

18:36.160 --> 18:37.160
will arrive today.

18:37.240 --> 18:38.720
As the relative of the victim,

18:38.800 --> 18:40.760
of course I need to come
and explain the situation.

18:40.840 --> 18:43.400
You're quite well-informed, Ms. Jiang Li.

18:44.040 --> 18:46.920
Your timing is just right too.

18:47.760 --> 18:50.320
It's nothing compared to your strategies.

18:55.720 --> 18:58.600
You must be the Director
of the Office of Weaving and Dyeing.

19:00.280 --> 19:01.240
My name is Tang Fan.

19:03.560 --> 19:04.480
May I know who she is?

19:04.560 --> 19:06.480
She's the daughter
of Chancellor Jiang, Jiang Li.

19:06.560 --> 19:08.040
Ms. Jiang Li.

19:08.840 --> 19:09.960
So you are Ms. Jiang Li.

19:10.040 --> 19:12.040
My apologies for not recognizing you.

19:13.600 --> 19:15.240
The Office has received a report

19:15.320 --> 19:18.440
about the Ye family's
Soochow brocade case in Luyang.

19:18.520 --> 19:19.640
Director.

19:19.720 --> 19:22.560
The Soochow brocade
of the Ye family has caused death.

19:23.160 --> 19:25.080
You're responsible
for matters related to weaving.

19:25.160 --> 19:27.480
However, there is a homicide case here.

19:28.080 --> 19:29.760
I have to investigate it.

19:29.840 --> 19:32.080
The homicide case isn't solved yet.

19:32.160 --> 19:35.080
Please bear with us, Director.

19:35.160 --> 19:36.520
Any progress on the investigation?

19:37.320 --> 19:38.880
The Ye family refuses to cooperate.

19:39.560 --> 19:41.120
It might take some time.

19:42.320 --> 19:46.480
But Ms. Jiang Li keeps standing here.

19:47.120 --> 19:50.480
Perhaps she's leveraging on the Office
to make us release Mr. Ye.

19:54.280 --> 19:55.120
Director.

19:56.080 --> 19:57.800
Governor Tong is saying

19:57.880 --> 20:01.080
that you have great authority

20:01.760 --> 20:04.080
and someone can leverage it.

20:08.120 --> 20:08.960
Governor Tong.

20:09.480 --> 20:10.320
Mind your words.

20:11.240 --> 20:13.080
The Ye family has never
disobeyed the Governor.

20:13.760 --> 20:16.400
However, the Governor has kept
my uncle in custody for days.

20:17.320 --> 20:19.320
Now, the Ye family is wrongfully accused.

20:19.400 --> 20:20.800
The deceased couldn't rest in peace,

20:21.280 --> 20:22.720
yet the Governor can't find anything.

20:24.480 --> 20:27.840
You're famous
for being quick and efficient.

20:28.560 --> 20:31.040
I'm afraid that you'll need
to stay longer in Luyang this time.

20:32.760 --> 20:33.600
If so,

20:34.080 --> 20:35.480
I have to report to my superior

20:35.560 --> 20:37.240
that the Governor

20:37.320 --> 20:39.240
is delaying the investigation.

20:39.840 --> 20:41.640
It's important for you
to investigate the case,

20:42.400 --> 20:44.320
yet I don't dare
to release him just like that.

20:44.800 --> 20:47.120
If the Ye family is the culprit,

20:48.720 --> 20:52.640
the higher-ups will surely
hold them responsible.

20:56.400 --> 20:58.840
Since the Governor is over a barrel
to release my uncle,

20:58.920 --> 21:00.960
I'll bring Director Tang

21:01.040 --> 21:02.320
to investigate the other places.

21:03.120 --> 21:04.480
You won't meddle

21:05.480 --> 21:07.160
in the Office's investigation, right?

21:07.240 --> 21:08.560
Of course not.

21:09.360 --> 21:10.240
Director.

21:10.320 --> 21:12.760
Please investigate this thoroughly

21:12.840 --> 21:15.080
and bring justice to the people of Luyang.

21:15.640 --> 21:16.760
That's my responsibility.

21:20.040 --> 21:21.240
Take care. I won't see you off.

21:29.200 --> 21:30.440
INTEGRITY CREATES AUTHORITY

21:30.520 --> 21:34.200
So they weren't here
to ask me to release him.

21:34.280 --> 21:35.920
They just don't want me to meddle in this.

21:36.880 --> 21:39.000
Should I send someone to watch them?

21:40.560 --> 21:42.360
We'd better not give them
a chance to fault us.

21:42.840 --> 21:44.320
Let's not do anything.

21:45.920 --> 21:48.320
Even if they were
to begin an investigation now,

21:48.400 --> 21:51.400
they wouldn't find anything so quickly.

21:52.400 --> 21:53.680
Let's wait for orders from the capital.

21:55.640 --> 21:56.600
Yes.

22:02.080 --> 22:03.280
Director.

22:03.360 --> 22:05.400
You've traveled a long way to Luyang.

22:05.480 --> 22:06.480
I'll escort you to rest.

22:06.960 --> 22:07.920
Ms. Jiang,

22:08.000 --> 22:10.080
you even praised me

22:10.160 --> 22:11.280
for being efficient at work.

22:11.840 --> 22:13.360
How can I rest now?

22:14.280 --> 22:15.840
You've read my mind so well.

22:17.520 --> 22:19.360
I'm not supposed to disturb you.

22:20.080 --> 22:21.520
But my family is in trouble,

22:21.600 --> 22:22.440
so I'm very worried.

22:22.920 --> 22:24.280
Hence, I have to trouble you.

22:24.360 --> 22:25.320
LUYANG GOVERNMENT OFFICE

22:25.400 --> 22:28.320
This is my responsibility.
You're not troubling me in any way.

22:28.920 --> 22:31.000
I trust that
you must have found some clues

22:31.080 --> 22:32.320
throughout this time.

22:32.880 --> 22:33.880
You can tell me about it.

22:35.600 --> 22:36.920
The Soochow brocades

22:37.000 --> 22:39.280
that caused skin rashes
after people wore them

22:39.360 --> 22:41.280
were delivered
to the Ye family's weaving mill.

22:41.840 --> 22:44.760
They have been left untouched,
making it easier for you to examine.

22:45.240 --> 22:46.320
You're the expert.

22:47.160 --> 22:49.240
We need your expertise
to solve the mystery.

22:49.320 --> 22:51.600
If you require our assistance,

22:51.680 --> 22:53.080
we won't ask

22:53.560 --> 22:54.720
any questions.

22:56.520 --> 22:59.120
You're thoughtful indeed. I'm impressed.

23:00.160 --> 23:01.040
Come on.

23:01.520 --> 23:02.480
Let's go

23:03.440 --> 23:04.280
to the weaving mill.

23:05.680 --> 23:06.520
Please.

23:30.280 --> 23:31.120
Director.

23:32.640 --> 23:34.600
Are these Soochow brocades problematic?

23:34.680 --> 23:36.720
The Soochow brocade's scent
comes from incense.

23:37.840 --> 23:38.960
Hence, it has a smoky smell

23:39.040 --> 23:40.280
and its scent is prominent.

23:40.840 --> 23:44.160
However, this Soochow brocade

23:44.240 --> 23:45.840
not only smells like incense

23:46.640 --> 23:48.520
but also has a slight hint

23:49.760 --> 23:50.880
of sweetness.

23:50.960 --> 23:51.800
Sweetness?

23:52.840 --> 23:54.040
How is that possible?

23:58.320 --> 23:59.440
There's indeed a sweet scent.

24:01.880 --> 24:03.800
Do you know what the smell is, Ms. Ye?

24:04.360 --> 24:05.240
I have no idea.

24:05.320 --> 24:07.000
I feel a bit dizzy.

24:08.320 --> 24:09.560
Li Yu. Put out the flame.

24:11.280 --> 24:12.280
Are you all right?

24:20.040 --> 24:21.520
It's gone once away from the fire.

24:21.600 --> 24:23.120
There's a slight scent of burnt hair.

24:23.200 --> 24:25.720
The burnt part is grayish
and breaks when pressed.

24:25.800 --> 24:26.880
The original materials are fine.

24:27.440 --> 24:30.440
The sweetness must have developed
in the later stages.

24:30.520 --> 24:31.680
Something was added

24:31.760 --> 24:33.800
to the incense or the final products.

24:34.600 --> 24:35.760
It's Tuoluo from the Western Region.

24:37.160 --> 24:38.000
Tuoluo?

24:40.120 --> 24:41.040
Do you know it, Ms. Ye?

24:42.680 --> 24:44.680
My father saw it
while he was traveling around.

24:44.760 --> 24:46.360
My father also said that

24:46.440 --> 24:48.400
Tuoluo is a type of plant
in the Western Region.

24:48.480 --> 24:50.240
After extraction
and concoction of its juice,

24:50.320 --> 24:52.600
it exhibits analgesic properties
when used in small amounts.

24:52.680 --> 24:53.680
It's also hallucinogenic

24:53.760 --> 24:54.640
and highly addictive.

24:54.720 --> 24:57.640
However, unprocessed Tuoluo is poisonous.

24:58.200 --> 24:59.800
A few drops can be deadly.

25:00.360 --> 25:02.200
It causes ulceration all over the body.

25:02.280 --> 25:03.680
You're indeed knowledgeable.

25:04.520 --> 25:09.120
May I ask why the Soochow brocade
smells like Tuoluo?

25:09.200 --> 25:11.080
The incense for the Soochow brocade

25:11.160 --> 25:13.040
is handmade by my father.

25:13.120 --> 25:15.440
All these years, nothing went wrong.

25:15.520 --> 25:17.080
Why would we destroy our own reputation

25:17.160 --> 25:18.800
and harm the innocent with this poison?

25:19.680 --> 25:20.720
Ms. Ye.

25:20.800 --> 25:23.120
Before the matter is investigated clearly,

25:23.880 --> 25:24.720
I'm sorry,

25:25.360 --> 25:27.000
but the Ye family
is still under suspicion.

25:27.080 --> 25:29.680
The Tuoluo flower is rare.

25:29.760 --> 25:31.320
It grows in a very specific environment.

25:31.400 --> 25:33.600
Aside from the southern part
of the Western Region,

25:33.680 --> 25:35.400
it cannot survive in other areas.

25:35.480 --> 25:38.160
It costs at least a few taels of silver

25:38.240 --> 25:39.440
or even dozens of taels.

25:39.520 --> 25:41.320
The more poisonous it is,
the higher the price.

25:42.120 --> 25:44.800
To poison people to death
using the Soochow brocade,

25:45.880 --> 25:47.400
it'd cost over a hundred taels.

25:48.360 --> 25:50.440
A bolt of premium Soochow brocade

25:50.520 --> 25:51.920
is only dozens of taels.

25:52.000 --> 25:55.200
Adding the Tuoluo flower
worth hundreds of taels

25:55.280 --> 25:56.800
into the Soochow brocade

25:56.880 --> 25:58.040
is not only costly

25:58.120 --> 25:59.200
but also causes death.

25:59.280 --> 26:00.680
A merchant definitely won't do this.

26:02.120 --> 26:04.120
I think someone is trying
to frame the Ye family

26:04.680 --> 26:06.880
by infusing poison
into the Soochow brocade.

26:06.960 --> 26:08.240
We must trace its origin.

26:08.320 --> 26:10.480
We need to find out
the source of the poison.

26:10.560 --> 26:12.520
Since Tuoluo isn't a local plant,

26:12.600 --> 26:13.680
it must have been brought

26:13.760 --> 26:15.360
into Luyang through merchants.

26:16.200 --> 26:19.120
If we investigate
the merchants entering Luyang annually,

26:19.200 --> 26:20.640
will we be able to trace the source?

26:20.720 --> 26:24.000
To find the source of the Tuoluo flower,
we need to report it to the authorities.

26:24.080 --> 26:26.280
The Office of Weaving and Dyeing
can't investigate it.

26:30.880 --> 26:32.600
I understand your concerns, Director.

26:33.280 --> 26:34.120
However,

26:34.880 --> 26:37.080
if you manage to find anything useful,

26:37.760 --> 26:40.480
my father will reward you bountifully.

26:44.600 --> 26:45.440
Director.

26:45.520 --> 26:48.560
Won't you consider taking this chance
to befriend Chancellor Jiang?

26:48.640 --> 26:50.920
Do you know
what the most dangerous thing is?

26:53.760 --> 26:54.920
Greed.

26:55.520 --> 26:57.480
Jiang Li is assuming
her father's authority

26:57.560 --> 26:59.120
and you're taking it seriously.

26:59.200 --> 27:00.600
I don't care who wants to investigate.

27:00.680 --> 27:04.600
As Office of Weaving and Dyeing officials,
finding out about the Tuoluo flower

27:04.680 --> 27:05.840
gets the job done.

27:05.920 --> 27:07.680
Whether the culprit

27:07.760 --> 27:09.440
is the Ye family or someone else,

27:10.960 --> 27:12.080
it has nothing to do with me.

27:12.640 --> 27:14.480
What should we do then?

27:14.560 --> 27:15.600
Pretend.

27:16.560 --> 27:19.400
Then tell Ms. Jiang Li
that we've done our best

27:20.120 --> 27:20.960
but to no avail.

27:22.320 --> 27:23.280
Genius.

27:23.840 --> 27:25.520
We won't offend any parties then.

27:27.520 --> 27:28.960
The Office of Weaving and Dyeing

27:29.040 --> 27:31.120
obviously wants us
to investigate on our own.

27:31.200 --> 27:32.760
If we can't find anything,

27:33.600 --> 27:35.680
will my father be imprisoned forever?

27:35.760 --> 27:36.880
Calm down first.

27:37.760 --> 27:39.280
At least we have a lead

27:39.360 --> 27:40.280
to follow now.

27:41.520 --> 27:43.120
If only my father were around.

27:43.200 --> 27:45.440
I know nothing about logistics.

27:45.520 --> 27:47.960
I don't even know who to go to
for investigation.

27:50.680 --> 27:51.640
I have a person in mind.

27:52.400 --> 27:53.640
He might be of help.

27:55.520 --> 27:58.520
DATONG ESCORT AGENCY

28:01.360 --> 28:03.560
DATONG ESCORT AGENCY

28:05.640 --> 28:07.800
Miss, should we get a couple of guards

28:07.880 --> 28:08.880
to go with us?

28:10.120 --> 28:10.960
It's all right.

28:11.880 --> 28:12.720
Come on.

28:23.560 --> 28:24.840
Stay still. Have mercy on me.

28:25.840 --> 28:27.360
Please spare me.

28:28.360 --> 28:29.280
Stop shaking.

28:29.360 --> 28:30.560
I can't aim properly.

28:31.360 --> 28:33.360
Please. I dare not do it again.

28:34.040 --> 28:34.880
No.

28:34.960 --> 28:36.200
Stop.

28:40.360 --> 28:41.760
This is fun.

28:42.560 --> 28:44.520
It's really exciting.

28:46.160 --> 28:47.160
- Light it.
- Stop.

28:47.240 --> 28:48.120
Or I'll go deaf.

28:48.600 --> 28:50.360
I did it. I stole it.

28:52.280 --> 28:53.120
You.

28:53.200 --> 28:55.160
I treated you well.

28:56.080 --> 28:57.680
The escort agency is losing money.

28:57.760 --> 28:59.520
How could you steal my wheels?

29:00.640 --> 29:01.560
Boss.

29:02.720 --> 29:04.040
- Stay still.
- Don't!

29:08.080 --> 29:10.680
- Come on.
- Don't.

29:16.080 --> 29:17.040
Shun.

29:17.120 --> 29:18.240
Drag him outside.

29:18.320 --> 29:19.160
Yes.

29:19.800 --> 29:20.680
Uncle Mingyu.

29:22.600 --> 29:23.880
You've been in Luyang for days.

29:24.360 --> 29:25.880
Now you think of me.

29:25.960 --> 29:27.280
I'm here today

29:27.360 --> 29:29.000
to make a big deal with you, Uncle Mingyu.

29:30.040 --> 29:31.000
Have a seat.

29:35.600 --> 29:38.360
Haven't you heard
what the Ye family says about me?

29:40.200 --> 29:41.960
You're bold to come here.

29:42.040 --> 29:44.480
I heard that
you're not careful in making friends

29:45.360 --> 29:47.320
and you were deceived in a major deal.

29:47.400 --> 29:49.000
You need money now.

29:49.080 --> 29:50.080
Did you investigate me?

29:50.560 --> 29:52.280
Jia'er is concerned about you.

29:52.360 --> 29:53.760
Hence, she asked around.

29:53.840 --> 29:56.040
The Ye family is in trouble now

29:56.120 --> 29:57.520
and they have time to care about me?

29:57.600 --> 29:59.000
We're a family.

29:59.080 --> 30:00.200
Why behave aggressively?

30:00.280 --> 30:01.920
If you're here to be the peacemaker,

30:02.000 --> 30:03.200
you can leave now.

30:03.280 --> 30:05.880
I'm here today to ask you for a favor.

30:06.360 --> 30:08.600
After it's done,
I'll invest money in your escort agency.

30:09.280 --> 30:11.520
If you think I'm here

30:11.600 --> 30:12.880
just to joke with you,

30:13.400 --> 30:14.520
I will leave now.

30:18.080 --> 30:19.000
What favor do you need?

30:19.840 --> 30:21.640
- Carrots. Fresh carrots.
- Wontons.

30:21.720 --> 30:23.200
- I'll have a look.
- Check it out.

30:23.280 --> 30:25.320
- A bowl of wontons, sir.
- All right.

30:25.400 --> 30:29.040
LONGXING PAWNSHOP

30:29.120 --> 30:29.960
Well…

30:30.640 --> 30:32.200
Do we need to dress up like this?

30:33.760 --> 30:36.320
Didn't you say there are a lot of rules
in the black market?

30:36.880 --> 30:38.600
If a rich brat misspoke,

30:38.680 --> 30:41.200
it won't make things
hard for you, will it?

30:41.280 --> 30:43.000
You're right.

30:43.840 --> 30:44.800
- Lead the way.
- Come on.

30:51.440 --> 30:52.360
Shoulder to shoulder.

30:52.440 --> 30:53.320
Hanging around.

30:53.400 --> 30:55.240
Which one?

30:55.320 --> 30:57.920
My friend's escort carriage.

31:00.520 --> 31:01.600
Just the two of you?

31:05.840 --> 31:06.760
Introduce us to him.

31:08.320 --> 31:09.320
Come on in.

31:37.640 --> 31:38.480
Come on.

31:39.360 --> 31:40.680
Who are we meeting with?

31:40.760 --> 31:42.960
The head of Luyang's
ghost market, Lai Biao.

31:43.040 --> 31:44.800
Rumor has it
that he used to serve in the army

31:44.880 --> 31:46.600
and killed millions on the battlefield.

31:46.680 --> 31:48.200
He's now in charge of the black market.

31:49.160 --> 31:51.640
And I heard he can do things
the government office

31:52.120 --> 31:53.040
can't do.

31:56.760 --> 31:58.080
Making money with raw wheat.

31:58.160 --> 31:59.000
Light a fire.

32:04.120 --> 32:04.960
What does it mean?

32:05.880 --> 32:07.400
It means that we're stupid and rich.

32:09.520 --> 32:11.120
Let's see who the foolish one is later.

32:12.680 --> 32:14.080
Keep quiet when we're inside.

32:14.640 --> 32:15.480
I'll go first.

32:23.520 --> 32:24.880
Mr. Biao. They're here.

32:25.880 --> 32:26.720
Have a seat.

32:38.360 --> 32:39.320
What do you want?

32:40.480 --> 32:41.880
My master is a drug addict.

32:42.440 --> 32:43.920
He likes the Western Region's Tuoluo

32:44.000 --> 32:45.480
but couldn't find it in Luyang.

32:45.560 --> 32:48.040
Please show us the way, Mr. Biao.

32:49.160 --> 32:50.080
Tuoluo?

32:51.760 --> 32:52.800
It's not easy to find.

32:53.360 --> 32:54.840
My master said

32:54.920 --> 32:56.160
if you can help us find it,

32:56.240 --> 32:59.600
you can keep the change, Mr. Biao.

33:00.240 --> 33:01.400
That's really generous of you.

33:02.240 --> 33:04.400
Unfortunately, you're too late.

33:04.480 --> 33:05.920
We just released a batch.

33:06.480 --> 33:07.800
We can't give them to you so soon.

33:11.840 --> 33:14.520
My master really wants it.

33:14.600 --> 33:16.080
Don't you understand

33:16.600 --> 33:19.400
what I said?

33:19.480 --> 33:22.320
Tell me where the previous batch is.

33:22.400 --> 33:24.160
I'll ask the person to sell me some.

33:25.120 --> 33:26.480
You're not here to buy goods.

33:27.040 --> 33:28.640
You're here to look for him.

33:30.440 --> 33:31.440
Mr. Biao,

33:32.000 --> 33:34.840
there's no harm in telling me
who that person is.

33:35.680 --> 33:36.840
To be honest,

33:36.920 --> 33:38.920
officials from the capital
are investigating him.

33:39.560 --> 33:41.480
If you're dragged into this,

33:42.360 --> 33:43.480
it'll be bad.

33:46.320 --> 33:47.280
You dare to threaten me?

33:50.480 --> 33:52.840
Why would I be scared
of officials from the capital?

33:53.560 --> 33:54.400
Liu.

33:54.960 --> 33:56.120
Send the guests off.

33:56.200 --> 33:58.080
Filter my guests from now on.

33:58.600 --> 33:59.440
Let's go.

34:01.440 --> 34:02.280
Never mind then.

34:02.760 --> 34:04.160
Let's think of another way.

34:04.640 --> 34:05.680
What a joke.

34:06.600 --> 34:08.960
You're the head of Luyang's black market.

34:09.560 --> 34:11.159
Your customer is offering a deal,

34:11.239 --> 34:13.239
yet you're chasing us out.

34:14.199 --> 34:15.360
I'm sure you're just

34:15.440 --> 34:17.040
incapable of getting it done.

34:17.120 --> 34:17.960
How dare you!

34:19.760 --> 34:22.400
There are dos and don'ts
in the ghost market.

34:23.120 --> 34:24.760
Asking for the buyer's details

34:25.679 --> 34:27.400
is against my rules.

34:29.239 --> 34:30.920
Rules?

34:31.000 --> 34:32.639
If he dares to buy it,

34:33.280 --> 34:34.560
is he afraid of being discovered?

34:35.320 --> 34:37.840
What if I insist
on getting an answer today?

34:39.040 --> 34:39.920
You

34:42.760 --> 34:43.880
can name your condition.

34:47.360 --> 34:48.920
You're brave indeed.

34:49.000 --> 34:51.760
Then I'll give you a chance
according to the rules.

34:54.280 --> 34:56.840
Do you dare to take up the challenge?

34:57.680 --> 34:58.560
What do you want?

34:58.640 --> 35:00.040
Your friend is familiar with it.

35:00.520 --> 35:01.360
Ask him.

35:06.120 --> 35:07.360
The Golden Water Formation challenge.

35:10.040 --> 35:10.960
Golden Water Formation?

35:15.320 --> 35:16.200
My lord.

35:16.280 --> 35:18.920
Wu Lan sent a message saying Chu Lan
will arrive in Luyang tonight.

35:19.000 --> 35:20.160
They'll meet
at the west district's residence.

35:20.240 --> 35:21.280
Be prepared.

35:21.760 --> 35:23.440
Tell her to buy us
as much time as possible.

35:23.520 --> 35:24.520
Yes.

35:25.120 --> 35:26.760
My lord, there's one more thing.

35:27.320 --> 35:30.080
Jiang Li and Ye Mingyu
went to the black market disguised.

35:33.000 --> 35:33.840
Why?

35:33.920 --> 35:37.200
They probably went to seek Lai Biao's help
for the Ye family's Soochow brocade.

35:37.280 --> 35:39.920
Judging by their looks,

35:40.000 --> 35:41.640
they won't give up if they don't succeed.

35:41.720 --> 35:42.920
I even heard

35:43.000 --> 35:45.080
that Lai Biao has
the Golden Water Formation rule too.

35:50.120 --> 35:50.960
Well…

35:52.880 --> 35:54.080
Golden Water Formation?

35:55.960 --> 35:57.000
What formation is it?

35:57.080 --> 35:58.280
You can think of it

35:58.360 --> 36:00.400
as a group of people
drinking a lot together.

36:04.280 --> 36:06.760
The Golden Water Formation begins!

36:10.120 --> 36:12.280
The so-called Golden Water Formation
is a drinking game.

36:12.360 --> 36:13.880
The dice total determines the winner.

36:13.960 --> 36:15.400
If you lose, you need to drink.

36:15.960 --> 36:16.880
According to the rules,

36:17.360 --> 36:18.600
if they get drunk first,

36:18.680 --> 36:20.320
they will get things done.

36:20.400 --> 36:21.720
LOSE, WIN

36:21.800 --> 36:23.320
Liu wins.

36:24.000 --> 36:29.400
- Drink!
- Drink!

36:29.480 --> 36:30.560
- It's all right.
- Drink!

36:30.640 --> 36:32.440
Since we're doing
the Golden Water Formation challenge,

36:32.520 --> 36:34.240
- I'm going all out.
- Drink!

36:34.320 --> 36:36.200
- Look at those weaklings.
- Drink!

36:36.280 --> 36:38.240
- I can easily defeat ten of them.
- Drink!

36:38.320 --> 36:44.800
- Drink!
- Drink!

36:44.880 --> 36:49.920
- Great!
- Nice!

36:50.000 --> 36:51.920
Another round!

37:01.760 --> 37:03.880
This mister wins.

37:05.640 --> 37:09.680
- Drink!
- Drink!

37:09.760 --> 37:13.760
- Drink!
- Drink!

37:14.320 --> 37:15.720
The two of us must drink two bowls.

37:16.440 --> 37:18.600
There are so many of them,
yet they drink two bowls too.

37:18.680 --> 37:21.240
- Cool!
- That's the Golden Water Formation's rule.

37:21.320 --> 37:23.320
We need to defeat
thrice the number of challengers

37:23.400 --> 37:24.920
in order to compete with Lai Biao.

37:27.600 --> 37:29.400
Third round.

37:33.560 --> 37:37.640
- Drink!
- Drink!

37:51.480 --> 37:53.640
- Drink!
- Drink!

38:02.280 --> 38:06.400
- Drink up!
- Drink!

38:06.480 --> 38:07.840
- Drink!
- Drink!

38:08.720 --> 38:09.600
- Drink!
- Drink!

38:13.360 --> 38:15.160
Stand up.

38:15.240 --> 38:16.680
You can't drink anymore?

38:16.760 --> 38:18.720
Who else is there?

38:19.680 --> 38:21.840
Last round.

38:22.800 --> 38:24.960
Mr. Biao is here.

38:25.040 --> 38:29.720
- He's here? Mr. Biao!
- He came? Mr. Biao!

38:29.800 --> 38:31.360
- Uncle Mingyu.
- Mr. Biao!

38:31.440 --> 38:32.880
- Can you still drink?
- Mr. Biao!

38:32.960 --> 38:34.080
- I'm fine.
- Mr. Biao!

38:34.160 --> 38:37.840
- Don't worry.
- Mr. Biao!

38:37.920 --> 38:41.400
- Mr. Biao!
- Mr. Biao.

38:43.240 --> 38:44.160
You're rather lucky.

38:44.240 --> 38:46.880
No one was able to defeat us.

38:46.960 --> 38:48.120
You're the only one left.

38:49.160 --> 38:51.120
I don't want to bully you
since you're outnumbered.

38:52.120 --> 38:54.560
Just tell us…

38:57.200 --> 38:58.160
Uncle Mingyu.

38:59.160 --> 39:00.360
Uncle Mingyu.

39:01.840 --> 39:03.040
Wake up.

39:03.120 --> 39:04.320
You can't collapse now.

39:08.920 --> 39:09.760
What is this?

39:10.840 --> 39:11.920
Hang on for two rounds.

39:12.000 --> 39:13.040
Wake me up with this later.

39:16.000 --> 39:16.960
It hurts.

39:20.400 --> 39:21.840
Uncle Mingyu.

39:21.920 --> 39:22.840
Hold on.

39:22.920 --> 39:24.000
We're not done yet.

39:26.120 --> 39:27.080
If you lose,

39:27.560 --> 39:28.480
honor your word.

39:29.760 --> 39:31.040
He said I won't honor my word.

39:33.760 --> 39:36.760
I, Lai Biao, always honor my word.

39:39.120 --> 39:41.360
Start!

39:47.120 --> 39:48.480
Mr. Biao wins!

39:48.560 --> 39:55.200
- Mr. Biao!
- Mr. Biao!

39:55.280 --> 39:56.640
You're really daring, sir.

39:56.720 --> 39:59.080
You dare to challenge my formation
with only one partner.

39:59.160 --> 40:01.600
I'll drink with you in this round.

40:03.800 --> 40:06.280
- As expected of Mr. Biao.
- Yes.

40:08.760 --> 40:11.880
From now on, I won't show you any mercy.

40:24.280 --> 40:29.400
- Drink!
- Drink!

40:35.040 --> 40:39.320
- Drink!
- Drink!

40:59.400 --> 41:03.000
- Drink!
- Drink!

41:04.400 --> 41:06.680
Your dice is problematic.

41:07.360 --> 41:08.240
Let's change it then.

41:09.600 --> 41:10.800
Truth be told,

41:11.280 --> 41:12.720
I've been playing the dice for ages.

41:13.360 --> 41:15.600
I know the numbers just by listening.

41:16.240 --> 41:17.320
You can't defeat me.

41:17.960 --> 41:19.000
Hold on.

41:19.880 --> 41:21.400
You can't beat me at drinking

41:21.480 --> 41:22.480
or playing the dice.

41:22.560 --> 41:24.360
Why are you wasting your time?

41:24.920 --> 41:26.720
I'm not drunk yet.

41:27.560 --> 41:28.840
When you get drunk,

41:28.920 --> 41:30.320
who will bring you home?

41:30.400 --> 41:33.120
- I…
- Are you going to spend the night here?

41:34.920 --> 41:35.760
I'll bring him home.

41:37.040 --> 41:37.880
Who's that?

41:54.520 --> 41:55.640
Drink as much as you want.

41:56.120 --> 41:57.920
If you get drunk, I'll bring you home.

41:58.440 --> 42:00.200
I thought at this moment,

42:01.440 --> 42:02.760
you would say

42:02.840 --> 42:04.320
that you'd drink on my behalf.

42:04.400 --> 42:06.760
- If you beg me, I--
- Please.

42:08.000 --> 42:10.200
You're really shameless.

42:10.840 --> 42:12.520
Is this considered a favor?

42:12.600 --> 42:13.720
No.

42:13.800 --> 42:14.640
Good.

42:17.880 --> 42:18.720
You…

42:19.320 --> 42:20.160
What about me?

42:20.760 --> 42:22.000
Don't you chicken out.

42:23.840 --> 42:25.080
Drink until he drops.

42:26.560 --> 42:27.600
Is he

42:28.360 --> 42:29.520
your savior

42:30.160 --> 42:31.280
or your enemy?

42:31.360 --> 42:32.880
It's none of your business.

42:32.960 --> 42:34.280
I'm competing with him.

42:34.880 --> 42:35.720
Who are you?

42:38.360 --> 42:40.080
It's no fun playing with him.

42:40.680 --> 42:42.480
Let's have a good game together,

42:43.280 --> 42:44.120
General Biao.

42:48.360 --> 42:49.880
Do you know each other?

42:49.960 --> 42:52.160
He was my father's nemesis.

42:52.240 --> 42:54.320
He was involved in a case later on
and became a bandit.

42:55.040 --> 42:57.280
I didn't expect him
to become the head of this market.

42:58.320 --> 43:00.280
Consider me unlucky
to fall into your hands.

43:00.840 --> 43:01.840
Do whatever you want

43:02.440 --> 43:03.280
with me.

43:20.040 --> 43:21.480
Is your father

43:21.560 --> 43:22.520
Xiao Minghan?

43:23.600 --> 43:24.440
That's right.

43:25.400 --> 43:27.400
You both like to play the hero

43:27.480 --> 43:29.240
rescuing damsels in distress.

43:29.800 --> 43:30.760
I'm warning you.

43:30.840 --> 43:31.960
According to our rules,

43:32.760 --> 43:35.560
if you join halfway through,
you need to double up your drinks.

43:38.880 --> 43:39.720
You roll the dice.

43:39.800 --> 43:41.360
I'm very lucky today.

43:48.120 --> 43:49.640
Start.

43:54.080 --> 43:56.200
Mr. Biao wins.

43:56.280 --> 43:58.080
- Mr. Biao!
- Mr. Biao!

44:02.800 --> 44:07.640
- Drink!
- Drink!

44:07.720 --> 44:10.760
If this continues,
we can't win even if there are ten of him.

44:11.560 --> 44:12.680
What should I do?

44:16.080 --> 44:17.320
Truth be told,

44:17.400 --> 44:18.840
I've been playing the dice for ages.

44:19.360 --> 44:21.560
I know the numbers just by listening.

44:21.640 --> 44:22.480
Hang on for two rounds.

44:22.560 --> 44:23.600
Wake me up with this later.

44:24.560 --> 44:25.840
It's my turn to counterattack.

44:26.480 --> 44:27.320
You roll it.

44:28.600 --> 44:29.520
Do you trust me now?

44:30.120 --> 44:31.400
I'm borrowing your luck.

44:43.480 --> 44:44.560
What are you doing?

44:44.640 --> 44:46.040
I'm feeling a bit sleepy.

44:46.120 --> 44:47.360
I'm just trying to stay awake.

44:47.440 --> 44:49.880
- You…
- The Golden Water Formation

44:49.960 --> 44:51.600
doesn't prohibit fireworks, right?

44:52.760 --> 44:53.680
Open it.

44:54.560 --> 44:56.160
The mister wins!

45:00.600 --> 45:02.560
Why are you only using this idea now?

45:03.320 --> 45:04.280
What did you say?

45:05.360 --> 45:07.040
Are you trying to get me drunk?

45:08.560 --> 45:09.920
Why would I do that?

45:11.160 --> 45:12.840
You're so suspicious.

45:13.880 --> 45:14.840
Are you not upset now?

45:19.440 --> 45:20.400
What are you mumbling?

45:21.200 --> 45:22.120
Again!

45:22.680 --> 45:24.400
Another round.

45:36.680 --> 45:37.520
PROMOTE GOOD AND CONDEMN EVIL

45:45.400 --> 45:46.240
That's enough!

45:49.840 --> 45:50.680
You

45:51.760 --> 45:52.640
won.

45:52.720 --> 45:53.880
What?

45:53.960 --> 45:55.240
Say that again.

45:55.320 --> 45:56.280
- What?
- What was that?

45:56.360 --> 45:57.600
Enough is enough.

45:57.680 --> 45:59.080
If this continues,

45:59.160 --> 46:01.360
everyone will lose their hearing.

46:01.440 --> 46:04.160
Can you tell us

46:04.240 --> 46:05.840
who bought the Tuoluo flower now?

46:07.240 --> 46:08.280
Wait a minute.

46:08.360 --> 46:11.720
I want to have a talk
with your defeated opponent first.

46:16.200 --> 46:18.800
Are you here for me

46:19.360 --> 46:20.880
or to save that young lad?

46:20.960 --> 46:21.800
Both.

46:21.880 --> 46:24.040
I want to ask a favor, General Biao.

46:24.120 --> 46:25.720
Why should I help you?

46:25.800 --> 46:27.360
My father saved your life before.

46:27.920 --> 46:28.920
You're just and frank

46:29.000 --> 46:30.760
and never got involved
in partisan disputes.

46:31.320 --> 46:33.920
You were framed and imprisoned
after offending Li Zhongnan,

46:34.000 --> 46:35.000
then exiled to Nanjiang.

46:35.920 --> 46:37.800
My father knew that you were innocent.

46:37.880 --> 46:40.200
He admired your spirit, so he let you go.

46:41.720 --> 46:43.440
And this time, I'm dealing

46:44.440 --> 46:45.920
with Li Zhongnan's party.
